{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the secret game of an ancient order \u2014 a single\u2011player roguelike auto battler played on a 3\u00d73 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/df68c10d21b8caa7bfe78d34e43937bd.poster.avif?t=1771937332\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/df68c10d21b8caa7bfe78d34e43937bd.webm?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/df68c10d21b8caa7bfe78d34e43937bd.mp4?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit strange allies, position them with care, and empower them with occult artifacts to survive each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings new enemies, unpredictable events, and the chance to uncover the true purpose of the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/2fec94e79f0fe4955b83fc5995b8ce35.poster.avif?t=1771937332\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/2fec94e79f0fe4955b83fc5995b8ce35.webm?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/2fec94e79f0fe4955b83fc5995b8ce35.mp4?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple rules. Infinite strategies.</strong><br> <br>Order Automatica\u2019s battles are fought automatically \u2014 your job is to prepare. Spend your gold, place units on the grid, and combine them with items, cell effects, and indulgences to create unstoppable synergies. Victory comes not just from raw strength, but from clever placement and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of ways to break the game.</strong><br><br><br> Unlock a growing roster of unique units, powerful items, and battlefield effects.  <br> Experiment with countless combinations to outsmart increasingly dangerous enemies. Lose all your candles and the ritual resets \u2014 but with every run, you learn new ways to bend the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/a6e6f23cfc458569e3fff63f6de8ddbb.poster.avif?t=1771937332\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/a6e6f23cfc458569e3fff63f6de8ddbb.webm?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/a6e6f23cfc458569e3fff63f6de8ddbb.mp4?t=1771937332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical battles on a 3\u00d73 grid</strong> with a unique roguelike progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep synergies and clever unit placement</strong> as the key to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark tale of an order and occult rituals</strong> full of hidden mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes offering fresh challenges</strong> and virtually endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct pixel art and a haunting, hypnotic soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you complete the ritual\u2026 or will it consume you?</p>","back