/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical battles on a 3\u00d73 grid</strong> with a unique roguelike progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep synergies and clever unit placement</strong> as the key to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark tale of an order and occult rituals</strong> full of hidden mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes offering fresh challenges</strong> and virtually endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct pixel art and a haunting, hypnotic soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you complete the ritual\u2026 or will it consume you?</p>","developers":["New Beings"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/a0cde50a4033a317606f8cc3e730fbc2f1025d8a/header.jpg?t=1771937332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2105840/1767422008/fb1e169c7cd1851f2bbd22eba56ce401ebe0fc39/1756607844/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756610585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2105840/1767422008/fb1e169c7cd1851f2bbd22eba56ce401ebe0fc39/1756607844/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756610585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2105840/1767422008/fb1e169c7cd1851f2bbd22eba56ce401ebe0fc39/1756607844/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756610585","id":257191273,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191273/d046d937ef4cc82d07b60f19920bb4215b959dad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756610585"}],"name":"Order Automatica","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b